{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"export default function Component214() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"bg-white overflow-clip relative rounded-[16px] size-full\" data-node-id=\"410:497\" data-name=\"21 · Подтверждение удаления 4 товаров\">\n      <button className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[43px] left-[19px] overflow-clip top-[110px] w-[292px]\" data-node-id=\"410:500\" data-name=\"Действие / Не удалять\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[calc(50%-25px)] not-italic text-[#1a1a1a] text-[14px] text-left top-[10px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"410:501\">\n          отмена\n        </p>\n      </button>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[43px] left-[19px] overflow-clip top-[152px] w-[292px]\" data-node-id=\"410:502\" data-name=\"Действие / Подтвердить\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[calc(50%-28px)] not-italic text-[#5f0f10] text-[14px] text-left top-[10px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"410:503\">\n          удалить\n        </p>\n      </a>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] h-[40px] leading-[normal] left-[19px] not-italic text-[#1f1f1f] text-[15px] top-[27px] w-[292px]\" data-node-id=\"410:504\">\n        вы точно хотите удалить 4 товара?\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] h-[40px] leading-[0] left-[19px] not-italic text-[#a3a3a3] text-[12px] top-[55px] w-[292px]\" data-node-id=\"410:505\">\n        <p className=\"leading-[normal] mb-0\">Карточки будут удалены из всех магазинов.</p>\n        <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Восстановить их не получится.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"SUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Node ids have been added to the code as data attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`."},{"type":"text","text":"The generated code contains image and SVG URL constants, e.g. const image = `${assetPathPrefix}/<asset file name>`, where assetPathPrefix is declared once at the top of the code and every asset URL interpolates it. These URLs are temporary download sources and expire after 7 days. Download each asset into the project with curl -L, then replace its URL in the generated code with a reference to the downloaded asset. Never use the temporary URLs as runtime image sources."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"structuredContent":null,"isError":false}
